Hi all,

Just an alert.  I've been using genkernel for most of my kernels (manually
configured then just build with --no-clean all options).

However, genkernel-3.3.5 will no longer successfully build kernels for me.  I
get  errors at the busybox stage of the build.

I've unmerged and went back to 3.1.6 (previous stable) and it is working fine
again.

I'm trying to ID the problem before filing a bug report but thought people might
run into it before I'm able to file.

Brian..
